    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/1f0c2da16419686ddbe68e5e18fae691.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world has changed since the invention of airships thirty years ago. The steam-powered airships now fill the sky. Floating islands that were just a speck in the sky are now in reach. Find your way home from the unpredictable sea of clouds and the dangers it holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Indie ARPG with quests, crafting and puzzles <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the open-world in primitive steampunk airships and on foot <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Trade and gather resources  <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Manage the airship <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fight in airship-to-airship battles and melee and ranged combat <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play Solo or Split-Screen Co-Op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/bd58ebfd3bc5c99ffa58bb980468b361.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.poster.avif?t=1751536626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.webm?t=1751536626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.mp4?t=1751536626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/3235caeaf52194a1f0bf00826f8894e8.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/68126f7c45d284548970cc655657cb1a.poster.avif?t=1751536626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/68126f7c45d284548970cc655657cb1a.webm?t=1751536626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/68126f7c45d284548970cc655657cb1a.mp4?t=1751536626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/ad65eae17b9ecae33077364247d0a3a7.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/ac643c93a0910444bd3b4a4e997e3cc8.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/068c528e17fc68dc8f7ad00fe07389ba.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/e6c77097e968d59dd65c30dd3e4cfefc.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/c4add41b1504a141c00a2084eee2b1a5.avif?t=1751536626\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/6f7f0fbbbe23a6def92231084c87f